WEBVTT

00:02.540 --> 00:05.210
<b><i>Our earliest memory is</i></b>

00:05.290 --> 00:08.250
<b><i>the darkness underneath a bed.</i></b>

00:09.420 --> 00:11.510
<b><i> The water flea wallpaper.</i></b>

00:13.430 --> 00:15.470
<b><i>We doodled around it</i></b>

00:15.550 --> 00:17.220
<b><i>to make them a labyrinth.</i></b>

00:19.390 --> 00:20.970
<b><i>Back then</i></b>

00:21.060 --> 00:23.520
<b><i>in a room somewhere in a house somewhere,</i></b>

00:23.600 --> 00:26.270
<b><i>we lived with our mom, hiding.</i></b>

00:29.530 --> 00:32.110
<b><i>Then one day, we left that place.</i></b>

00:34.490 --> 00:35.820
<b>Mom?</b>

00:35.910 --> 00:37.700
<b>What are you looking at?</b>

00:39.240 --> 00:40.620
<b>-Whoa.
-Whoa.</b>

00:40.700 --> 00:42.370
<b><i>Our mom</i></b>

00:42.450 --> 00:44.790
<b><i>deeply loved Origon Village.</i></b>

00:45.460 --> 00:46.330
<b><i>But…</i></b>

00:53.800 --> 00:55.130
<b><i>in that same village</i></b>

00:55.220 --> 00:56.590
<b><i>she was murdered.</i></b>

01:06.270 --> 01:07.060
<b>Huh?</b>

01:11.190 --> 01:12.690
<b><i>So now…</i></b>

01:21.870 --> 01:23.120
<b><i>the two of us</i></b>

02:57.920 --> 03:00.090
<b>Why don't you join the boy scouts?</b>

03:00.180 --> 03:00.840
<b>Huh?</b>

03:00.930 --> 03:03.220
<b>You'll go camping in nature,</b>

03:03.300 --> 03:04.810
<b>going hiking,</b>

03:04.890 --> 03:09.140
<b>and make some great friends!</b>

03:09.230 --> 03:10.730
<b>Mh-hm!</b>

03:10.810 --> 03:13.480
<b>School is still on spring break,</b>

03:13.560 --> 03:15.610
<b>so until then… Hitori?</b>

03:15.690 --> 03:17.990
<b>Why do you look so upset?</b>

03:18.990 --> 03:20.900
<b>Do you not want me to</b>

03:21.660 --> 03:22.280
<b>be here?</b>

03:23.870 --> 03:26.160
<b>Of course we do!</b>

03:26.240 --> 03:28.000
<b>Stay here forever.</b>

03:28.080 --> 03:31.080
<b><i>That's right. Forever and ever.</i></b>

03:33.710 --> 03:36.750
<b>We only barely avoided
being thrown to the lions.</b>

03:36.840 --> 03:38.800
<b>We narrowly escaped death.</b>

03:38.880 --> 03:41.550
<b>If we have to keep
pretending to be one person,</b>

03:42.180 --> 03:44.600
<b>we have no time for dilly-dallying.</b>

03:44.680 --> 03:45.760
<b>Right.</b>

03:46.600 --> 03:47.640
<b>It's about time</b>

03:47.720 --> 03:50.730
<b>we start searching for
the one who killed our mom.</b>

03:52.270 --> 03:55.360
<b>A room with water fleas on the wallpaper.</b>

03:55.440 --> 03:57.320
<b>If we find that,
it might tell us something.</b>

03:57.400 --> 04:01.030
<b>Right. We have to go through
every house in this village.</b>

04:01.110 --> 04:03.700
<b>Maybe we can go through the chimneys…</b>

04:03.780 --> 04:05.160
<b>You fool, Migi.</b>

04:05.240 --> 04:06.870
<b>Do you want to get burnt again?</b>

04:07.990 --> 04:10.910
<b>We have to go through the windows.</b>

04:11.000 --> 04:14.630
<b>If only we could just
ring the doorbell and go in.</b>

04:14.710 --> 04:17.290
<b>In broad daylight?</b>

04:18.670 --> 04:20.210
<b>That's it.</b>

04:22.260 --> 04:25.510
<b>Listen. What we have to do
is make some friends.</b>

04:25.590 --> 04:27.050
<b>If we make friends,</b>

04:27.140 --> 04:29.680
<b>they'll happily invite us to their homes.</b>

04:29.770 --> 04:31.430
<b>Dali, can I ask one question?</b>

04:31.520 --> 04:32.430
<b>Go ahead, Migi.</b>

04:34.770 --> 04:37.230
<b>How exactly does one make a friend?</b>

04:41.110 --> 04:42.490
<b>Listen.</b>

04:42.570 --> 04:45.070
<b>Fortunately there's a lot of kids here,</b>

04:45.160 --> 04:46.990
<b>and there's two of us.</b>

04:47.070 --> 04:49.950
<b>Throw enough mud at the wall,
some of it will stick.</b>

04:50.040 --> 04:50.950
<b>-Whack.
-Whack.</b>

04:51.040 --> 04:53.870
<b>So my dad put the bear skin on the floor</b>

04:53.960 --> 04:55.960
<b>and mom yelled at him,</b>

04:56.040 --> 04:57.630
<b>"Why do both of you</b>

04:57.710 --> 05:00.420
<b>need to spend all day lazing about!"</b>

05:12.930 --> 05:14.480
<b>Look at these pretty rocks.</b>

05:14.560 --> 05:16.140
<b>I'll give them to you.</b>

05:16.230 --> 05:17.400
<b>No thanks.</b>

05:17.480 --> 05:21.320
<b>You're going to need them
if you end up in Children's Limbo.</b>

05:21.400 --> 05:22.940
<b>I ain't dying yet.</b>

05:23.030 --> 05:25.450
<b>He's really desperate to make friends.</b>

05:25.530 --> 05:29.780
<b>No one wants to be
friends with an orphanage kid.</b>

05:29.870 --> 05:31.830
<b>Why don't you go be his friend,</b>

05:31.910 --> 05:33.580
<b>bird boy?</b>

05:33.660 --> 05:35.540
<b>Don't call me that.</b>

05:35.620 --> 05:36.620
<b>Why not?</b>

05:36.710 --> 05:39.670
<b>You always joined that
bird man contest, didn't you?</b>

05:44.260 --> 05:46.680
<b>Oh man. He's coming over here.</b>

05:48.340 --> 05:51.350
<b>Hi. My name is Hitori Sonoyama.</b>

05:51.430 --> 05:52.510
<b>Hitori?</b>

05:52.600 --> 05:53.810
<b>What a weird name.</b>

05:53.890 --> 05:54.980
<b>Can you fly?</b>

05:55.060 --> 05:57.390
<b>It may mean bird, but I can't fly!</b>

05:57.480 --> 05:58.810
<b>Hmm?</b>

05:58.900 --> 06:01.320
<b>Well, how about we become your friends?</b>

06:01.400 --> 06:03.940
<b>Really? You will?</b>

06:07.030 --> 06:09.160
<b>On one condition, though.</b>

06:13.870 --> 06:16.250
<b>You have to walk that line.</b>

06:16.330 --> 06:17.460
<b>Huh?</b>

06:17.540 --> 06:19.080
<b>If you do it with no hands,</b>

06:19.170 --> 06:20.420
<b>we'll be your friends.</b>

06:32.430 --> 06:34.220
<b>I can't believe he's doing it!</b>

06:36.770 --> 06:38.310
<b>What's going on?</b>

06:38.390 --> 06:40.310
<b>-What is that?
-Huh?</b>

06:42.940 --> 06:45.150
<b>I'll bet a billion he can't do it.</b>

06:45.230 --> 06:47.320
<b>I'll bet a trillion!</b>

06:48.150 --> 06:50.280
<b>They're just making fun of you…</b>

06:50.910 --> 06:52.320
<b>Don't try the impossible.</b>

07:01.580 --> 07:04.250
<b>Aw man. That didn't take long.</b>

07:05.170 --> 07:06.510
<b>Huh?</b>

07:06.590 --> 07:08.010
<b>-Huh?
-Eh?</b>

07:09.930 --> 07:10.680
<b>Huh?</b>

07:23.860 --> 07:25.940
<b>He keeps falling…</b>

07:27.530 --> 07:29.860
<b>and getting back up right away.</b>

08:02.900 --> 08:04.980
<b>Just give up already, dude.</b>

08:05.060 --> 08:07.110
<b>You really want friends that bad?</b>

08:07.190 --> 08:08.480
<b>It's hard to watch.</b>

08:08.570 --> 08:10.530
<b>Just cut it out, bird kid.</b>

08:11.650 --> 08:13.820
<b><i>Why won't he just quit?</i></b>

08:13.910 --> 08:15.070
<b><i>He's so stubborn.</i></b>

08:15.160 --> 08:16.490
<b><i>Give up.</i></b>

08:19.540 --> 08:20.700
<b><i>Quit.</i></b>

08:20.790 --> 08:22.210
<b><i>You can't do it.</i></b>

08:22.290 --> 08:23.830
<b><i>Stop it, man.</i></b>

08:24.540 --> 08:26.920
<b><i>Give up.</i></b>

08:27.000 --> 08:28.500
<b><i>Give up.</i></b>

08:29.380 --> 08:31.220
<b><i>Give up.</i></b>

08:32.170 --> 08:34.090
<b>Hitori!</b>

08:34.970 --> 08:37.260
<b>Don't you dare give up!</b>

08:37.350 --> 08:39.060
<b>Go all the way to the end!</b>

08:47.020 --> 08:49.270
<b>Fly!</b>

09:05.080 --> 09:06.120
<b>You promised!</b>

09:06.880 --> 09:08.630
<b>Let's be friends.</b>

09:09.590 --> 09:11.420
<b>You used your hands.</b>

09:11.760 --> 09:12.670
<b>So, anyway…</b>

09:13.760 --> 09:15.050
<b>Right!</b>

09:17.720 --> 09:18.550
<b>Pfh.</b>

09:19.600 --> 09:20.600
<b>I'll do it.</b>

09:22.100 --> 09:24.100
<b>Let's be friends, Hitori.</b>

09:24.180 --> 09:25.390
<b>W…</b>

09:25.480 --> 09:27.350
<b>Wait… Does that mean…</b>

09:28.020 --> 09:30.110
<b>I can go to your place?</b>

09:30.190 --> 09:31.150
<b>Huh?</b>

09:31.230 --> 09:32.400
<b>Of course!</b>

09:35.610 --> 09:37.280
<b>Come over today.</b>

09:37.360 --> 09:39.370
<b>I'll show you my bird.</b>

09:40.580 --> 09:41.410
<b>Yes!</b>

09:57.630 --> 09:59.050
<b>Welcome.</b>

09:59.140 --> 10:02.060
<b>Thanks for inviting me over.</b>

10:02.140 --> 10:04.770
<b>This is my mom's special cherry pie.</b>

10:04.850 --> 10:05.890
<b>Thanks.</b>

10:05.980 --> 10:07.560
<b>Let's eat it together.</b>

10:29.460 --> 10:32.630
<b>Both my parents work, so…</b>

10:32.710 --> 10:35.050
<b>Oh, both your mom and dad?</b>

10:35.130 --> 10:37.340
<b>None of them are home right now.</b>

10:40.260 --> 10:42.890
<b>Akiyama, do you have a sister?</b>

10:42.970 --> 10:44.180
<b>Where is she?</b>

10:44.520 --> 10:46.520
<b>I think she's still asleep.</b>

10:46.600 --> 10:49.980
<b>She's so lazy, even if it's spring break.</b>

10:51.020 --> 10:53.480
<b>Anyways, this pie is so good.</b>

10:55.730 --> 10:57.690
<b><i>Dangit, Dali…</i></b>

10:57.780 --> 11:00.740
<b><i>Just because you were born</i>
<i>a tiny bit before me, </i></b>

11:00.820 --> 11:02.700
<b><i>you always get the good stuff…</i></b>

11:03.370 --> 11:06.330
<b><i>Guess a little brother</i>
<i>has to walk the bumpy road…</i></b>

11:17.340 --> 11:19.050
<b>This is my room.</b>

11:23.800 --> 11:26.600
<b>Ah, I'll just
borrow the restroom for a minute.</b>

11:26.680 --> 11:27.680
<b>Go ahead.</b>

11:29.180 --> 11:30.140
<b>What?</b>

11:30.230 --> 11:32.730
<b>The right room has
water fleas on the wall?</b>

11:33.940 --> 11:35.150
<b>I'm sure of it.</b>

11:35.230 --> 11:36.860
<b>I saw it with my own eye.</b>

11:36.940 --> 11:38.570
<b>And doodles?</b>

11:38.650 --> 11:40.360
<b>I'll check for those.</b>

11:40.450 --> 11:42.320
<b>Be careful, Migi.</b>

11:42.410 --> 11:44.450
<b>His sister is sleeping in there.</b>

11:45.080 --> 11:46.160
<b>Don't wake her up.</b>

11:46.990 --> 11:47.830
<b>I won't.</b>

11:49.040 --> 11:51.620
<b>I'll make sure to keep Akiyama distracted.</b>

11:51.710 --> 11:53.380
<b>Search properly.</b>

11:53.460 --> 11:55.460
<b>Whoa, your room's so nice!</b>

11:56.040 --> 11:57.210
<b>Thanks.</b>

11:59.720 --> 12:02.510
<b><i>It really is always me</i></b>

12:04.550 --> 12:06.720
<b><i>who walks the bumpy road.</i></b>

12:10.890 --> 12:12.560
<b><i>It looks identical.</i></b>

12:13.190 --> 12:14.650
<b><i>But the doodles…</i></b>

12:14.730 --> 12:15.520
<b><i>aren't there.</i></b>

12:16.110 --> 12:17.440
<b><i>Unless…</i></b>

12:25.120 --> 12:27.080
<b>I came up with this one</b>

12:27.160 --> 12:30.080
<b>based on Franz Reichelt's parachute suit,</b>

12:30.160 --> 12:32.870
<b>and this one I based on a Rogallo wing.</b>

12:32.960 --> 12:34.580
<b>And then this one…</b>

12:34.670 --> 12:36.880
<b><i>I didn't anticipate this side of him.</i></b>

12:36.960 --> 12:39.670
<b><i>I guess if I just let him keep talking, </i></b>

12:39.760 --> 12:41.840
<b><i>it'll buy us loads of time.</i></b>

12:43.340 --> 12:44.430
<b>Sorry.</b>

12:44.510 --> 12:46.680
<b>It's no fun listening to me rambling.</b>

12:46.760 --> 12:48.720
<b>Let's play a boardgame.</b>

12:48.810 --> 12:51.560
<b>My sister still has it, I think.</b>

12:51.770 --> 12:52.430
<b>Huh?</b>

12:52.810 --> 12:53.980
<b>Wait!</b>

12:54.060 --> 12:55.520
<b>Tell me more!</b>

12:55.600 --> 12:56.810
<b>About yourself.</b>

12:56.900 --> 12:57.730
<b>Huh?</b>

13:02.150 --> 13:03.360
<b>Oh, I see.</b>

13:03.450 --> 13:05.780
<b>So you wanted to become a bird.</b>

13:06.450 --> 13:07.530
<b><i>Phew.</i></b>

13:08.080 --> 13:09.740
<b>This is the first time</b>

13:09.830 --> 13:12.330
<b>I ever told anyone.</b>

13:12.410 --> 13:13.080
<b>Huh?</b>

13:13.160 --> 13:14.210
<b>Why is that?</b>

13:14.290 --> 13:16.380
<b>If I told anyone in this place,</b>

13:16.460 --> 13:17.880
<b>they'd just laugh at me.</b>

13:20.920 --> 13:22.590
<b>I won't laugh.</b>

13:25.470 --> 13:26.930
<b>Hitori…</b>

13:27.970 --> 13:30.180
<b><i>I'll listen all you want.</i></b>

13:30.260 --> 13:32.220
<b><i>As long as it buys me time.</i></b>

13:33.560 --> 13:35.060
<b>I guess if it's you…</b>

13:35.140 --> 13:36.980
<b>I can show it.</b>

13:48.820 --> 13:50.450
<b><i>No doodles…</i></b>

13:53.120 --> 13:55.540
<b><i>So it wasn't this house.</i></b>

13:56.580 --> 13:57.540
<b>Tsk.</b>

14:09.090 --> 14:10.050
<b>How is it?</b>

14:10.140 --> 14:13.100
<b>It's a prototype
and still needs some adjustments…</b>

14:15.600 --> 14:16.350
<b>Huh?</b>

14:16.850 --> 14:18.400
<b>Does it weird you out?</b>

14:19.610 --> 14:21.320
<b>Ah, not at all!</b>

14:21.400 --> 14:24.280
<b>I just stepped back to get full-body view!</b>

14:24.360 --> 14:25.690
<b>Full-body?</b>

14:25.780 --> 14:29.200
<b>Right, I haven't even seen it myself.</b>

14:29.280 --> 14:32.160
<b>My sister has
a full-body mirror in her room.</b>

14:32.240 --> 14:33.700
<b>I'll go look!</b>

14:37.790 --> 14:38.750
<b>I will</b>

14:39.210 --> 14:40.290
<b>see it all.</b>

14:43.550 --> 14:45.420
<b>Your loneliness.</b>

14:45.510 --> 14:46.630
<b>Your sadness.</b>

14:47.090 --> 14:49.510
<b>I want to see it all!</b>

15:13.080 --> 15:15.990
<b>We learned something again today.</b>

15:16.080 --> 15:19.000
<b>Gaining friends is painful.</b>

15:19.080 --> 15:22.250
<b>And the pain may be
even larger than the gain.</b>

15:23.290 --> 15:25.050
<b>You think so?</b>

15:25.130 --> 15:27.170
<b>What I've learned today is</b>

15:27.710 --> 15:31.010
<b>tat the bumpy road
leads to a sweet treasure.</b>

15:31.090 --> 15:31.680
<b>Ow.</b>

15:31.760 --> 15:34.680
<b>Knock it off with the nonsense.</b>

15:35.260 --> 15:36.600
<b>Our goal is</b>

15:36.680 --> 15:39.730
<b>finding the one who killed our mom.</b>

15:41.020 --> 15:42.940
<b>And then kill them.</b>

15:43.610 --> 15:44.900
<b>In order to do that</b>

15:44.980 --> 15:47.440
<b>we have to remain composed.</b>

15:48.820 --> 15:51.860
<b>I know that, Dali.</b>

15:53.870 --> 15:55.830
<b>Welcome, Hitori!</b>

15:56.410 --> 15:59.500
<b>This is my mom's special cherry pie.</b>

15:59.580 --> 16:01.500
<b>Why, thank you!</b>

16:01.580 --> 16:04.840
<b>Maruta had barely come home from camp</b>

16:04.920 --> 16:09.210
<b>before he said
he wanted to invite you over.</b>

16:09.300 --> 16:11.260
<b>Isn't it great, Maruta,</b>

16:11.340 --> 16:13.140
<b>that you made a new friend.</b>

16:13.220 --> 16:14.390
<b>Yes, Mama!</b>

16:14.470 --> 16:16.560
<b>I am so happy.</b>

16:20.390 --> 16:23.520
<b>We never wanted him to invite us over.</b>

16:23.600 --> 16:25.940
<b>It's kind of suspicious.</b>

16:26.020 --> 16:27.730
<b>He must have a hidden motive.</b>

16:27.820 --> 16:31.490
<b>That rodent is the type
to suddenly lose his temper.</b>

16:31.570 --> 16:32.650
<b>Let's be careful.</b>

16:32.740 --> 16:33.740
<b>Yes.</b>

16:33.820 --> 16:35.570
<b>By the way, this time -</b>

16:36.580 --> 16:39.040
<b>I'll be the one to go.</b>

16:40.120 --> 16:41.000
<b>Fine.</b>

16:41.080 --> 16:42.960
<b>Just suppress your feelings</b>

16:43.040 --> 16:45.170
<b>and remain composed. Got it?</b>

16:47.460 --> 16:50.420
<b>What a nice room!</b>

16:50.510 --> 16:52.470
<b>You have so many toys!</b>

16:53.260 --> 16:54.260
<b>Don't touch it.</b>

16:55.090 --> 16:56.720
<b>I don't want your germs.</b>

16:59.220 --> 17:00.680
<b>I won't touch it.</b>

17:00.770 --> 17:02.560
<b>Here. Gloves.</b>

17:05.560 --> 17:08.480
<b>Okay Migi. You got this.</b>

17:13.530 --> 17:15.570
<b>Yay! I won!</b>

17:15.660 --> 17:17.370
<b>Reset.</b>

17:17.450 --> 17:18.490
<b>Eh?</b>

17:25.250 --> 17:26.540
<b>Hold it in.</b>

17:31.590 --> 17:32.880
<b>Thank you for th…</b>

17:41.430 --> 17:44.690
<b><i>We have to remain composed.</i></b>

17:45.810 --> 17:47.650
<b><i>You're right, Dali.</i></b>

17:47.730 --> 17:49.980
<b>By the way,</b>

17:50.070 --> 17:52.360
<b>you're from the orphanage, right?</b>

17:52.440 --> 17:55.360
<b>Did you have any toys there?</b>

17:56.030 --> 17:59.030
<b>I mean, we didn't have fancy video games,</b>

17:59.120 --> 18:00.370
<b>but we made do.</b>

18:01.200 --> 18:02.830
<b>With what?</b>

18:02.910 --> 18:05.040
<b>Like with this and this,</b>

18:05.120 --> 18:07.790
<b>we'd have a rock-paper-scissors battle.</b>

18:07.880 --> 18:09.790
<b>That sounds fun!</b>

18:09.880 --> 18:11.500
<b>Let's play that!</b>

18:12.170 --> 18:14.590
<b><i>None of the wallpapers</i>
<i>have water fleas on them.</i></b>

18:14.670 --> 18:16.970
<b><i>It's not this house.</i></b>

18:18.430 --> 18:20.760
<b>Rock-paper-sciss--</b>

18:20.850 --> 18:22.060
<b>Wait a second.</b>

18:22.140 --> 18:22.680
<b>Huh?</b>

18:22.760 --> 18:25.770
<b>I'm a complete beginner, so…</b>

18:27.100 --> 18:28.350
<b>Shouldn't you</b>

18:28.440 --> 18:31.400
<b>play with a handicap?</b>

18:32.230 --> 18:34.190
<b><i>I have to get Migi,</i></b>

18:34.280 --> 18:36.570
<b><i>return to the base,</i>
<i>and rethink the strategy.</i></b>

18:36.650 --> 18:39.360
<b>Rock-paper-scissors!</b>

18:42.370 --> 18:43.370
<b><i>Aha.</i></b>

18:43.450 --> 18:44.870
<b><i>Sounds fun.</i></b>

18:44.950 --> 18:48.500
<b>Rock-paper-scissors!</b>

18:50.000 --> 18:51.130
<b>Too slow.</b>

18:54.460 --> 18:57.380
<b>How many times do I gotta tell you?</b>

18:57.470 --> 18:59.800
<b>You need to use your left hand better.</b>

18:59.890 --> 19:02.720
<b>You can't use your right, remember?</b>

19:02.800 --> 19:06.850
<b>You really are a dumb little dingbat.</b>

19:07.640 --> 19:11.900
<b>Go back
into your momma's belly and start over.</b>

19:11.980 --> 19:12.560
<b>Right!</b>

19:12.650 --> 19:15.570
<b>You don't have a real momma, I forgot!</b>

19:21.450 --> 19:23.030
<b>Okay, new round.</b>

19:26.830 --> 19:27.870
<b>Hmm?</b>

19:30.710 --> 19:31.830
<b>Eh?</b>

19:33.960 --> 19:37.170
<b>Come on, don't run away.</b>

19:37.260 --> 19:38.630
<b>Over here.</b>

19:38.720 --> 19:39.550
<b>Hm?</b>

19:43.260 --> 19:44.220
<b>Well.</b>

19:44.300 --> 19:46.060
<b>Time for another round.</b>

19:47.100 --> 19:49.520
<b>That's a good boy.</b>

19:50.270 --> 19:52.980
<b><i>I won't let you get away.</i></b>

19:54.150 --> 19:57.480
<b><i>You're the perfect toy.</i></b>

19:57.570 --> 19:58.990
<b><i>I won't let you go.</i></b>

20:00.070 --> 20:01.740
<b>Hey, Hitori.</b>

20:01.820 --> 20:03.700
<b>For the next round,</b>

20:03.780 --> 20:06.700
<b>how about we say
the loser has to do what the winner says?</b>

20:06.790 --> 20:07.660
<b>Sure.</b>

20:08.620 --> 20:10.120
<b><i>Yay.</i></b>

20:11.870 --> 20:13.460
<b>Okay, let's go!</b>

20:13.540 --> 20:16.710
<b>Rock, paper, sc-</b>

20:16.800 --> 20:19.630
<b><i>Now you'll be mine forever.</i></b>

20:19.720 --> 20:20.970
<b>-issors!</b>

20:21.590 --> 20:22.380
<b>Eh?</b>

20:34.610 --> 20:35.560
<b>W… Wait…</b>

20:41.740 --> 20:42.910
<b>Stop!</b>

20:43.410 --> 20:45.370
<b>Stop!</b>

20:54.000 --> 20:54.880
<b><i>Migi? </i></b>

20:55.540 --> 20:56.540
<b><i>Why?</i></b>

20:56.630 --> 20:57.960
<b><i>Dali.</i></b>

20:58.050 --> 20:59.210
<b><i>Did you forget?</i></b>

20:59.760 --> 21:02.510
<b><i>We have to keep our composure.</i></b>

21:09.010 --> 21:09.890
<b>Yes!</b>

21:09.970 --> 21:12.640
<b>Okay, see you next scout meeting.</b>

21:14.520 --> 21:16.150
<b>Yes I shall l-look forward to</b>

21:16.230 --> 21:18.110
<b>s-seeing you s-soon…</b>

21:18.190 --> 21:21.570
<b>No need to be so polite, Maruta!</b>

21:22.150 --> 21:24.320
<b>Remember,
neither of us is above the other.</b>

21:26.620 --> 21:30.120
<b>If anything,
we'd just be a left and a right.</b>

21:30.200 --> 21:31.500
<b>That's all.</b>

23:06.630 --> 23:08.760
<b><i>I tell you!</i></b>

23:08.840 --> 23:11.050
<b>It's exhausting!</b>

23:11.140 --> 23:12.050
<b>Oh?</b>

23:12.140 --> 23:13.760
<b>The Isozakis,</b>

23:13.850 --> 23:18.230
<b>they wanted
everyone's laundry done seperately.</b>

23:18.310 --> 23:20.190
<b>A new old woman.</b>

23:21.020 --> 23:21.940
<b>Oh!</b>

23:22.020 --> 23:23.650
<b>You're home already?</b>

23:23.730 --> 23:24.860
<b>I'm home.</b>

23:24.940 --> 23:26.570
<b>Who is this?</b>

23:26.650 --> 23:29.530
<b>Oh, you must be Hitori.</b>

23:29.610 --> 23:31.110
<b>This is our maid,</b>

23:31.200 --> 23:32.620
<b>Mrs. Mitsuyama.</b>

23:34.330 --> 23:37.040
<b>Just call me Micchan.</b>
